 - `npm run dev` starts Vite at `http://127.0.0.1:5173/Tahion_Personal_site/`.
 - `npm run preview` serves the production build at `http://127.0.0.1:4173/Tahion_Personal_site/`.
 - `npm run check` runs ESLint, Prettier check, TypeScript, and production build.
+- `npm test` runs the built-in Node test runner for visual preference persistence and synchronization.
+
+## Visual Preferences
+
+The background variant and color theme are stored together as a versioned JSON record under `tahion.visual.preferences`:
+
+```json
+{ "version": 1, "variant": "signal", "theme": "acid" }
+```
+
+When that record is absent, valid values from the legacy raw-string keys `tahion.backdrop.variant` and `tahion.backdrop.theme` are migrated independently; invalid or missing fields use the `signal` and `acid` defaults. Legacy keys are preserved. Valid changes are synchronized between open same-origin tabs through `storage` events, while malformed records and unrelated storage events are ignored.
 
